Description    :
mod_uploader is an Apache C++ file uploader with Japanese and English
screens, upload progress, download passwords, deletion, RSS, and optional
thumbnails. This altered 3.2.0 port targets FreeBSD and Apache 2.4.

The user reported successful operation on FreeBSD/Apache. This Port
candidate still requires packaging, staging, poudriere and full HTTP tests.
